  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Specter, once a simple hatchling, witnessed the collapse of the Bubblegum Reservoir when raiders drained it dry. Now, haunted by the sight of his kin turned to candied husks, he roams the wastes as a silent guardian, seeking to avenge the fallen and reclaim what was lost.",
    "class": "Ghost Recon",
    "name": "Specter 'Bubblepop' Wraith",
    "personality": "Grimly pragmatic. Specter is haunted by visions of the past and future and now approaches every situation using his Cybercomm to strategically analyze and find the best odds, rarely smiling, and always seeming to anticipate the worst. Resourceful & macabre; Specter uses his knowledge of Subchain City's underbelly to scavenge and survive, turning scrap into tools and embracing the morbid humor of the apocalypse.",
